# AGENTS.override.md (local override example)

Copy this file to `AGENTS.override.md` in the project root for machine-local or personal defaults.

Do not commit `AGENTS.override.md`. It is gitignored by default.

Suggested uses:
- Personal command preferences (for example, prefer `uv` for Python workflows).
- Local environment quirks that do not belong in shared project rules.
- Temporary investigation instructions while debugging.

Do not use overrides to bypass core safeguards from `AGENTS.md`, role files, or escalation rules.
